      "variable": "dif",
      "state": "`od_ec_decode_bool_q15()` reaches `if (dif >= vw)` with `sizeof(dif)` bytes consumed but only 0 bytes initialized, so the sink branch uses uninitialized entropy-decoder state."
    },
    {
