      "variable": "tile_buffers[r][c].data, tile_buffers[r][c].size, data_end",
      "state": "The selected tile span ends at `tile_buffers[r][c].data + tile_buffers[r][c].size`, which exceeds the real tile-group `data_end`; the decoder has recorded an out-of-range tile buffer."
    }
